        {
            "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
            "aliases": [
                "KONGFU_44_INTRO"
            ],
            "objdata": {
                "Flow": [
{
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "Bad news for you,time traveller.",
              "zh": "告诉你一个坏消息，时间旅行者。"
                        }
        },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "I have completed my latest project.",
              "zh": "我已经完成了我的最新项目。"
                        }
        },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "My masterpiece,which is intergrated the successors's essence of The Big Three.",
              "zh": "我的杰作，凝聚着武林三巨头传人们的精湛。"
                        }
            },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "You have to stop here…",
              "zh": "你们早该停下了。"
                        }
            },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "Your neighbor have already messed up countless timelines just because of that damn taco,has't he?",
              "zh": "你的邻居为了那个该死的玉米卷已经祸害了数不清的时空了，难道不是吗？"
                        }
            },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "I suggest you think about the accidents that inflexible guy caused.",
              "zh": "我劝你好好思考一下那个疯子加自大狂造成的事故。"
                        }
            },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "Here to advise you to stop resisting,to avoid digging your own grave.",
              "zh": "在此望你束手，以免自误。"
                        }
            },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "We are unstoppable.",
              "zh": "我们势如破竹。"
                        }
            },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "If you still insist on helping him.",
              "zh": "若你执意要为虎作伥。"
                        }
            },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "Next year on this day will be your memorial day.",
              "zh": "明年的今天就是你们的忌日。"
                        }
            },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "Both of you.",
              "zh": "你们两个的。"
                        }
            },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "And.Of course,including your trashy time machine.",
              "zh": "当然，也包括你们那台无用的时间机器。"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "PLAYFUL",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "I just want to have that taco again.",
                            "zh": "我就是想再吃一次玉米卷。"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "PLAYFUL",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "There's no need to say any more.Let's beat the bossman so that he won't even have any fragment of armour left!My neighbor!",
                            "zh": "不用说那么多了。让我们打僵尸博士个片甲不留吧！我的邻居！"
                        }
                    },
                    {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "WUHAHAHAHA!The human brain is truly fascinating,haha!HAAAAH!",
              "zh": "呜哈哈哈哈!人类的脑子真是有趣呢，哈哈!哈哈哈哈！"
            }
                    },
                    {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "Heh.",
              "zh": "呵。"
            }
                    },
                    {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "This time,I will destroy you once and for all!",
              "zh": "这次，我将一劳永逸的解决你们！"
            }
          }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
            "aliases": [
                "KONGFU_44_OUTRO"
            ],
            "objdata": {
                "Flow": [
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SPECIAL17",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "An apple a day, keeps the doctor away~",
                            "zh": "一天一苹果，博士远离我~"
                        }
        },
{
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "Dash it!",
              "zh": "可恶！"
                        }
        },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "Why are you so obsessed with it?",
              "zh": "为什么你对那个玉米卷那么执着呢？"
                        }
        },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "What's there to be so precious about a taco? Why not just go buy another one? It's so simple.",
              "zh": "玉米卷有什么好珍惜的呢？直接再去买一个不就好了，多么简单的事。"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Yeah, you asked me why I didn't buy another one.",
                            "zh": "是呀，你问我为什么不去再买一个。"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SHOUT",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Because I'm CRAAAZY!!!!",
                            "zh": "因为我疯了！！！！"
                        }
                    },
                    {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "…",
              "zh": "…"
            }
                    },
                    {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "I never expected that you could actually defeat my new mech in such a way.",
              "zh": "我没有想到你们能用这种方式打败我的新机甲。"
            }
                    },
                    {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "But I still have fallback plan.",
              "zh": "但我仍留有后手。"
            }
                    },
                    {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "Next time, my forces shall pierce your defenses with irresistible momentum!",
              "zh": "下一次，我的僵尸大军必将以不可阻挡之势击穿你的防线。"
            }
                    },
                    {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "There's still time!Time Traveller!!!",
              "zh": "时间旅行者，我们来日方长！"
            }
          }
                ]
      }
